{"id":"wb-4-69","name":"泰陵","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T12:17:40+00:00","status":"ready","title":"泰陵 (隋朝)","text":"泰陵是中国隋文帝杨坚及其独孤皇后的合葬陵园，位于陕西省咸阳市杨陵区五泉乡王上村。\n\n陵园平面呈方形，四周的陵墙已基本被破坏，唯北墙尚且有部分残存，据残基测量，南北长652米，东西宽756米。呈覆斗形。陵底部东西长166米，南北宽152米；顶部东西长48米，南北宽38米。陵前有刻“隋文帝泰陵”石碑一通。","shortened":true,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B3%B0%E9%99%B5_(%E9%9A%8B%E6%9C%9D)","revisionId":88912372,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=88912372","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/f8f135039624315601aa3f25.jpg","title":"隋泰陵_2024-11-24_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E9%9A%8B%E6%B3%B0%E9%99%B5_2024-11-24_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0e/%E9%9A%8B%E6%B3%B0%E9%99%B5_2024-11-24_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Kcx36","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​隋泰陵，咸阳市杨陵区","width":320,"height":240},"textScope":"body-excerpt"}